msgid "This row *is* the entry, rather than an opinion about one a lower layer holds. Stored rather than inferred from the row carrying a body: under partial opinions a reference may carry an icon and no title, so body-presence stops telling the two apart -- and a reference to a row the app has since deleted would resurrect as a label-less button."
